                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <p class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest z-10 pt-4 border-t border-white/5">
                            HTMX POST /api/increment → Zig Pointer → Re-Render → O(1) Local Patch
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                        <div class="space-y-4">
